# Materialized frozen-incumbent fixtures (harness.frozen) — transient build
# artifacts regenerated on demand, never committed.
eval/frozen/

# afk operational records (enrolled 2026-08-08, #13). `.afk/config.toml` IS tracked —
# it is the executor contract; everything the driver *writes* is machine-local noise.
# `.afk/question.md` is deliberately NOT ignored: a parked slice's escalation has to
# travel with its branch or the answer never reaches the executor.
.afk/transcripts/
.afk/worktrees/
.afk/mailbox/
.afk/parity/
.afk/cycle.lock
docs/dev-cycle/telemetry.jsonl
docs/dev-cycle/last-run.md
docs/dev-cycle/quarantine-log.md
